    ATTAKK<br />
    Musterstrasse 1<br />
    8000 Zürich<br />
    Switzerland
  </p>
  <p>
    Email: hello@atk-collective.ch<br />
    Phone: [add a phone number, or remove this line]<br />
    Legal form: [sole proprietorship / association — whichever applies]<br />
    UID / VAT number: [CHE-xxx.xxx.xxx, if registered]
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible for content</h2>
